			<item>
				<title>Your Great Work does not matter.</title>
				<link>https://kin-design.is-cool.dev/posts/your-great-work/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 21:09:42 +0200</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kin-design.is-cool.dev/posts/your-great-work/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Codex Runicus, a law code written in runes (c. 1300 CE)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;heading&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Create for the sake of creation, not for the sake of accomplishment, and you will be truly free from the shackles of normality.”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;the-great-work&#34;&gt;The Great Work&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Great Work is a term from Alchemy and Hermeticism, referring to a singular ultimate work of the practitioner. Their &lt;em&gt;Magnum Opus&lt;/em&gt;. The work that defines them and drives them to discover the hidden secrets of the universe.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
